    "detailed_description": "AST-Hero is a classic shoot \u2018em up born out of one question: <br><br><i>If the 1979 hit Asteroids had been made today, what would it look like?</i> <br><br>Take your ship through 40 levels and traverse the vast fringes of space to reach and destroy the Mighty Mothership. Others have gone before you. None have returned. <br><br>A battle ship without weapons is nothing but target practice. Arm yourself with and upgrade multiple weapons in your fight for survival, along with a range of special bonus weapons to turn the tide of battle. You\u2019ll go up against a horde of enemy ships and mini-bosses until reaching the Mighty Mothership. Preparation and skill are key to survival.  <br><br>Notable Features: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 difficulty levels <br></li><li>Procedural environments <br></li><li>Bumpin\u2019 soundtrack to evade death to <br></li><li>Voice acted tutorial<br></li><li>Upgrade Shop<br></li><li>Gamepad Compatible</li></ul>",
